<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Carmina Burana (Carl Orff)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1935–1936</span><span class="sg-chain-h">set to music as the opening and closing movement, &quot;Fortuna Imperatrix Mundi&quot;</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Carmina Burana (Ray Manzarek)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1983</span><span class="sg-chain-h">album interpreting Orff's piece in a contemporary framework</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Excalibur (film trailer)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1981</span><span class="sg-chain-h">Orff's setting used in its entirety</span></li></ul></section>
